  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L.I.F.E SUPPORT FUND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low Income Families Education (L.I.FE) Support Fund.  It is an annual education endowment fund for children who are forced out of school due to financial constraints beyond their control. L.I.F.E Support Fund will serve as an emergency support fund to students from single parent homes who are challenged with funding while schooling at all educational levels due to unavoidable circumstances. Imagine the number of individuals who were robed of their full potentials due to lack of school fees!</narrative>
  </description>
